chx:Build owl:disjointWith chx:Interface .
chx:Build owl:disjointWith chx:Data .
chx:Build owl:disjointWith chx:Ecosystem .
chx:Build owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Build owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:Operation owl:disjointWith chx:Interface .
chx:Operation owl:disjointWith chx:Data .
chx:Operation owl:disjointWith chx:Ecosystem .
chx:Operation owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Operation owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:Interface owl:disjointWith chx:Data .
chx:Interface owl:disjointWith chx:Ecosystem .
chx:Interface owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Interface owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:Data owl:disjointWith chx:Ecosystem .
chx:Data owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Data owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:Ecosystem owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Ecosystem owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:Semantics owl:disjointWith chx:Computing .
chx:hasOwner a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "owned by"@en ; rdfs:subPropertyOf rd:hasOwningConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "A concept owned by the concept it belongs to, as the chapter's examples use it between typed things; domain and range are the union of every type the A-Box shows on the two sides (BP-D57 step 3)."@en ;
    rdfs:domain [ <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( chx:Checksum chx:CompactTarget chx:Hmac chx:MerkleRoot chx:OpenPgpSignature chx:RandomNumber chx:Salt chx:UnixTime ) ] ;
    rdfs:range [ <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( chx:BlockHeader chx:CookieAuthentication chx:ReleaseVerification chx:RpcAuth ) ] ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .

#################################################################
# Connectedness repair (discipline v2.19.0, BP-D56 and BP-D57), 2026-10-19.
# The datatype properties the A-Box uses and nothing declared, then the relations
# between the chapter's subject branches that the chapter's own sources state.
#################################################################
chx:input a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "input expression"@en ; rdfs:comment "The expression an input/output example evaluates."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:output a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "output value"@en ; rdfs:comment "The value that evaluating the example expression gives."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:reportsChainWork a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "reports"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The getblockchaininfo call reports the chain work. Basis: the chapter says of Blockchain information (getblockchaininfo): 'its difficulty and chain work'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:BlockchainInfo ; rdfs:range chx:ChainWork ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:reportsDifficulty a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "reports"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The getblockchaininfo call reports the difficulty. Basis: the chapter says of Blockchain information (getblockchaininfo): 'its difficulty and chain work'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:BlockchainInfo ; rdfs:range chx:Difficulty ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:indexesTransactions a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "indexes"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The txindex option indexes every transaction. Basis: the chapter says of Transaction index (txindex): 'builds an index of every transaction so that getrawtransaction can find any of them'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:TransactionIndex ; rdfs:range chx:Transaction ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:sizesCacheOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "sizes the cache of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The dbcache option sizes the cache of the unspent-output set. Basis: the chapter says of Database cache (dbcache): 'sizes the cache of the unspent-output set'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:DatabaseCache ; rdfs:range chx:UtxoSet ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:acceptsBlocksFrom a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "accepts blocks from"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Blocks-only mode accepts blocks from peers but not unconfirmed transactions. Basis: the chapter says of Blocks-only mode: 'a node accepts blocks from its peers but not unconfirmed transactions'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:BlocksOnlyMode ; rdfs:range chx:Peer ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:timesBlockHeader a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "gives the times in"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin uses Unix time for the times in block headers. Basis: the chapter says of Unix time: 'Bitcoin uses it for the times in block headers'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:UnixTime ; rdfs:range chx:BlockHeader ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isComputedByShift a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is computed by"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The block subsidy is computed by shifting right once per 210,000 blocks. Basis: the chapter says of Block subsidy: 'is shifted right once for every 210,000 blocks'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:BlockSubsidy ; rdfs:range chx:BitShift ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isWrittenIn a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is written in"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Core's source code is written mainly in C++. Basis: the chapter says of Source code: 'mainly C++ in Bitcoin Core'; the chapter says of Programming language: 'the chapter meets C++ for the node'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:SourceCode ; rdfs:range chx:ProgrammingLanguage ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isDrawnForCookie a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is drawn for"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Random numbers are drawn for the cookie credential. Basis: the chapter says of Random number: 'for cookies and salts'; the chapter says of Cookie authentication: 'Bitcoin Core creates a random credential on each start'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:RandomNumber ; rdfs:range chx:CookieAuthentication ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isDrawnForSalt a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is drawn for"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Random numbers are drawn for salts. Basis: the chapter says of Random number: 'for cookies and salts'; the chapter says of Salt: 'A salt is a random value mixed into the hashing of a password'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:RandomNumber ; rdfs:range chx:Salt ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isFollowedByTests a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is followed by"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Compilation is followed by the unit tests. Basis: the chapter says of Compilation: 'is followed by the unit tests'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Compilation ; rdfs:range chx:SoftwareTesting ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isStoredInDataDirectory a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is stored in"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The cookie credential is stored in the data directory. Basis: the chapter says of Cookie authentication: 'stores it in the data directory as .cookie'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:CookieAuthentication ; rdfs:range chx:DataDirectory ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:usesHmac a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "uses"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The rpcauth option holds the HMAC-SHA256 of the password. Basis: the chapter says of Hashed credentials (rpcauth): 'the HMAC-SHA256 of the password under that salt'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:RpcAuth ; rdfs:range chx:Hmac ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:usesSalt a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "uses"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The rpcauth option holds a random salt. Basis: the chapter says of Hashed credentials (rpcauth): 'a user name, a random salt and the HMAC-SHA256 of the password'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:RpcAuth ; rdfs:range chx:Salt ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:includesCommandLineClient a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "includes"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The build produces the command-line client among its executables. Basis: the chapter says of Executable: 'bitcoin-cli the command-line client'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Executable ; rdfs:range chx:CommandLineClient ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:providesNode a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "provides"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The build produces bitcoind, which is the node. Basis: the chapter says of Executable: 'bitcoind is the node'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Executable ; rdfs:range chx:Node ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:buildsReproducibly a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "builds reproducibly"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A reproducible build produces identical files from the same source. Basis: the chapter says of Reproducible build: 'bit-for-bit identical files from the same source'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:ReproducibleBuild ; rdfs:range chx:SourceCode ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:checksAgainstChecksum a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is checked against"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A downloaded release is checked against the published checksums. Basis: the chapter says of Release verification: 'checked against the SHA-256 checksums the project publishes'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:ReleaseVerification ; rdfs:range chx:Checksum ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:checksSignature a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is checked against"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A downloaded release is checked against the signatures on the checksums. Basis: the chapter says of Release verification: 'and the signatures on them'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:ReleaseVerification ; rdfs:range chx:OpenPgpSignature ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:checksTransactions a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "checks"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A full node checks every confirmed transaction against every rule. Basis: the chapter says of Full node: 'checks every confirmed transaction against every rule of the system'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:FullNode ; rdfs:range chx:Transaction ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isUpdatedByBlock a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is updated for every"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A node updates the set of unspent outputs for every block. Basis: the chapter says of Set of unspent outputs: 'a node updates it for every block'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:UtxoSet ; rdfs:range chx:Block ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:deletesOldBlocks a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "deletes old"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A pruned node deletes old blocks. Basis: the chapter says of Pruned node: 'deletes old blocks to reduce disk use'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:PrunedNode ; rdfs:range chx:Block ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:isDeployedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is deployed by"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Soft forks are deployed through Bitcoin Improvement Proposals. Basis: the chapter says of Soft fork: 'BIP 9 lets several be deployed in parallel by signalling in the block version'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:SoftFork ; rdfs:range chx:ImprovementProposal ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:mapsKeysOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "maps the keys of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A JSON-LD context maps the keys of a JSON text to IRIs. Basis: the chapter says of JSON-LD context: 'maps the keys of a JSON text to IRIs'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:JsonLdContext ; rdfs:range chx:JsonFormat ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
chx:comesFromFullNode a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "comes from"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Data from your own node is authoritative because the node verified it itself. Basis: the chapter says of Verified data: 'Data from your own node is authoritative because the node verified it itself'; the chapter says of Full node: 'A full verification node checks every confirmed transaction against every rule of the system'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:VerifiedData ; rdfs:range chx:FullNode ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03/tbox> .
